### ===================================
### YouTube Video API Tests
### Base Path: /api/ai/ytb/video
### ===================================

# Note: Replace the video URL with an actual YouTube video URL for testing

@testVideoUrl = https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=dQw4w9WgXcQ

### Get Video Title
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/ai/ytb/video/title?url={{testVideoUrl}}

###

### Get Scrolling Subtitles
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/ai/ytb/video/subtitles/scrolling?url={{testVideoUrl}}

###

### Get Translated Subtitles - Chinese
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/ai/ytb/video/subtitles/translated?url={{testVideoUrl}}&language=zh

###

### Get Translated Subtitles - Japanese
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/ai/ytb/video/subtitles/translated?url={{testVideoUrl}}&language=ja

###

### Get Translated Subtitles - No Translation (English)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/ai/ytb/video/subtitles/translated?url={{testVideoUrl}}&language=en

###

### Download Translated Subtitles as File - Chinese
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/ai/ytb/video/subtitles/translated/download?url={{testVideoUrl}}&language=zh

###

### Download Translated Subtitles as File - Japanese
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/ai/ytb/video/subtitles/translated/download?url={{testVideoUrl}}&language=ja

###

### Get WebSocket Streaming Info
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/ai/ytb/video/subtitles/translated/stream

###

### Download YouTube Video (Streaming)
# Warning: This may take a long time and consume bandwidth
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/ai/ytb/video/download?url={{testVideoUrl}}

###

### Clean Subtitle Cache - Chinese
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/ai/ytb/video/subtitles?url={{testVideoUrl}}&language=zh

###

### Clean Subtitle Cache - All Languages
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/ai/ytb/video/subtitles?url={{testVideoUrl}}

###

### ----- Test with URL Encoded -----

### Get Title with Encoded URL
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/ai/ytb/video/title?url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.youtube.com%2Fwatch%3Fv%3DdQw4w9WgXcQ

###

### Get Subtitles with Short URL
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/ai/ytb/video/subtitles/scrolling?url=https://youtu.be/dQw4w9WgXcQ
